# V01 Habilidade BNCC sem conceito matemático (deve retornar zero linhas)
PREFIX cc: <https://contacomigo.org/ontology#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

SELECT ?h WHERE { ?h a cc:BNCCSkill . FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?h cc:addressesMathematicalConcept ?c } }
